exports[`characterization: POST /api/artifact (pre-Second-Brain baseline) > pins shape + mock output for a free-text query 1`] = `
{
  "artifactId": Any<String>,
  "bodyMarkdown": "**RSUs:** RSUs are not taxable at grant because they are unfunded, unsecured promises. Under the economic benefit doctrine, taxation does not occur until the RSU delivers actual property with ascertainable value.

For RSUs, the taxable event is delivery of shares, typically the date the vesting condition is satisfied and shares are transferred to the participant's brokerage account.

The predominant method for public company RSUs is: **Net share withholding (sell-to-cover):** On the vesting date, the plan administrator instructs the broker to withhold a number of shares equal in value to the tax withholding amount. Supplemental withholding rates apply to RSU income: 22% federal for amounts up to $1 million in the year and 37% for amounts over $1 million.",
  "citations": [
